   "description": "<div><b>User Story:</b><br></div><div><b>As a</b> development team leader,<br></div><div><b>I want</b> to build infrastructure modules for the Invoice Management System as microservices,<br></div><div><b>so that</b> I can provide these services to any third party.<br></div><div><br></div><div><b>Acceptance Criteria:</b><br></div><p style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">1.<span style=\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><b>Modular Architecture</b>:<br></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol\"><span style=\"\">·<span style=\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Develop the Invoice\nManagement System using a microservices architecture, where can be used by\nthird parties.<br></p><p style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">2.<span style=\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><b>Service Development</b>:<br></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol\"><span style=\"\">·<span style=\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Implement core\ninfrastructure modules, including authentication, authorization, invoice\nprocessing, payment integration, and notification services.<br></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol\"><span style=\"\">·<span style=\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Ensure each service can\noperate independently and scale as needed.<br></p><p style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px\" class=\"MsoListParagraph\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"\">3.<span style=\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><b>Deployment and Management</b>:<br></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol\"><span style=\"\">·<span style=\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Use containerization (e.g.,\nDocker) and orchestration tools (e.g., Kubernetes) to deploy and manage\nmicroservices.<br></p><p style=\"margin-left: 0.75in; text-indent: -0.25in; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Symbol\"><span style=\"\">·<span style=\"font: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Implement CI/CD pipelines\nfor automated testing, deployment, and updates.<br></p><div><br></div>",
